 "remarks": "PresentingMeadowpark Avenue East, your next home. This spacious, well-maintained 4-bedroom, 2-bath single family home is conveniently located in the Mid-Ridges section of town. The large eat-in kitchen was recently renovated and features new stainless steel appliances, and the updated baths add to the move-in appeal. Two fireplaces, one in the living room and one in the great room, add warmth and charm. The great room is ideal for family gatherings or could be used as an in-law space. Its separate front and back entrances, one leading straight to the backyard add flexibility. A brand-new deck will be ready by move-in. Close to shopping, dining, schools, and public transportation. Don't miss it!",
